# DragoAnt.MSBuildKit parts: <name> <default|optional> [required parts...]
# The folder of a part is msbuild/DragoAnt.MSBuildKit.<name> ("Trunk" is msbuild/DragoAnt.MSBuildKit).
Core default
Trunk default
Vcs.GitHub default
TfmConstants default
Packaging default
Testing default
Testing.XUnit.v3 default Testing
Locals.Compile default
Locals.DirectorySecrets default
Locals.Secrets default
PrivateAssets default
Project.RoslynComponent optional
Project.CodeAnalyzer optional Project.RoslynComponent
Project.CodeFixer optional Project.RoslynComponent Project.CodeAnalyzer
Project.SourceGenerator optional Project.RoslynComponent
PackageAsProj optional
ProjMetadata optional
EF optional
